# Everything an update-channel compromise would have to go through.
#
# Spacewalk is unsandboxed by necessity (a CGEvent tap, ScreenCaptureKit and
# private SkyLight calls), so Sparkle is the one remote-influenced path into a
# fully privileged process. These paths decide which signing key is trusted,
# what the feed says, and what the release script does with both. A change to
# any of them should be looked at by a human who is not the one proposing it.

